//  and the per-head gate (H fp32) once, then -- per page -- one K tile
//  (B*D fp8->fp32) and the B per-token scales (fp32, packed in the trailing
//  B*4 bytes of each KV block). Total shared = (H*D + H + B*D + B) * 4 =
