// non-optin LDS cap (no hipFuncSetAttribute opt-in). H=64 would stage
// 66 KB and need the opt-in the kernel does not yet have, so it is not
// exercised here (the headline value is proving H=32 -- the index_n_heads
// GLM-5.3 actually uses -- works where the tilelang path hangs).

